# Testing Standards

Canonical: `docs/ENGINEERING_STANDARD.md` · `docs/process/BUG_HANDLING.md` ·
`docs/dogfood/README.md` · `docs/devops/LOCAL_DEVELOPMENT.md`

## Prefer

| Change kind | Prefer |
| --- | --- |
| Parser / validator / domain | Unit tests |
| Notifiers / widgets | Widget tests |
| Visual chrome | Golden tests when stable (`--tags golden`) |
| Copilot bridge | `npm run check` in `tool/copilot_sdk_bridge` |
| Bugs | Regression test that fails before / passes after |

## Before commit (when code changed)

- Add or update tests for the change.
- Run relevant suites from `ai_tray/` (and bridge if touched).
- There is **no** ≥90% coverage hard gate.
- Manual dogfood for tray-visible behavior when practical.
